(text "R10-R12: OPTIONAL TERMINATION, DNP.\nChoose for cable and 20 mA encoder output limit.\nA+/A-, B+/B-, Z+/Z-: twisted pairs." (at 20.32 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e700affa-fddb-5fc8-8f83-c50f2e095d12"))
(text "400 P/R -> TIM3 x4 = 1600 counts/rev; Z = once/rev.\nCable colours / connector orientation: motor manual.\nShielded twisted pairs; chassis bond at cable entry." (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "137a6ad4-a3c8-5225-902c-47219536a49c"))
(text "U2: 5 V. Q4-Q6 translate to 3.3 V. U3: 3.3 V ONLY.\nU3 OE1/OE2/OE3 HIGH; unused OE4 and A4 LOW.\nU2 unused receiver inputs may float (fail-safe).\n100 nF at each IC; 1 uF nearby." (at 190.5 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c65bc15b-ee93-5693-8ba5-b5d396361204"))
(text "A/B -> PB4/PB5; Z -> PB6 rising-edge EXTI. All original signal polarities preserved.\nQ4-Q6: Diotec 2N2222A E=1/B=2/C=3. Keep collector-to-U3 wires short.\nCheck edge shape and transistor turn-off delay at the intended encoder speed." (at 20.32 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "657f5f0e-bf89-56bc-86c9-f8790d22b456"))
